            "body": "This has been kicking for a while but I finally attached a pull request that allows to enforce the use of a certain view engine by passing an object with a `url` and `engine` property like this:\r\n\r\n```js\r\ncan.view({\r\n  url: path,\r\n  engine: 'mustache'\r\n}, { message: 'Hi test' });\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt doesn't break backwards compatibility and allows using a specific view engine for any URL."
